<title>CANADA: Canada body details Soft White Wheat protein.</title>
<headline>Canada body details Soft White Wheat protein.</headline>
<dateline>WINNIPEG 1996-12-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Canadian Grain Commission on Monday detailed the protein content of Canada Western Soft White Spring Wheat.</p>
<p>			   No1 CWSWS</p>
<p>PROVINCE	SAMPLES   MEAN AVG  MIN. MAX. (PCT)</p>
<p>Saskatchewan     4	10.0	8.9  10.5</p>
<p>Alberta	  263	10.5	8.4  13.1</p>
<p>W. Canada	267	10.5	8.4  13.1</p>
<p>			   No2 CWSWS</p>
<p>PROVINCE	SAMPLES   MEAN AVG  MIN. MAX. (PCT)</p>
<p>Alberta	   36	10.8	8.7  11.9</p>
<p>			   No3 CWSWS</p>
<p>PROVINCE	SAMPLES   MEAN AVG  MIN. MAX. (PCT)</p>
<p>Alberta	   12	11.1     10.4  12.4</p>
<p>			   CW FEED</p>
<p>PROVINCE	SAMPLES   MEAN AVG  MIN. MAX. (PCT)</p>
<p>Alberta	    6	12.0     10.7  14.0</p>
<p>			   ALL GRADES</p>
<p>PROVINCE	SAMPLES   MEAN AVG  MIN. MAX. (PCT)</p>
<p>Saskatchewan     4	10.0	8.9  10.5</p>
<p>Alberta	  317	10.6	8.4  14.0</p>
<p>W. Canada	321	10.6	8.4  14.0</p>
<p>((Gilbert Le Gras 204 947 3548))</p>
